Capability sentinel for the managed-data-workflow probe.

The probe executes committed fixtures under testdata/workflows/managed-data
through the real Ptah CLI. It exercises Ptah's declarative reference/seed data
capability (//ptah:schema:data plus `ptah migrations data`), which Atlas CE
cannot express: Atlas OSS neither declaratively manages nor inspects reference
data. These fixtures are intentionally separate from the Atlas schema round-trip
corpus because they measure a Ptah-native capability (stokaro/ptah#663).
